# One spelling of every text file on every platform: templates and goldens
# are compared byte for byte, and packages digest the same everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# A vendored licence, kept exactly as its authors wrote it.
web/app/fonts/OFL.txt -text

# A declared extension's component: a `<view>` block and a `<script>` block,
# the shape of a Vue single-file component, so GitHub highlights it as one
# (the script, Rhai, reads close to JavaScript). `.uze` files stay out of
# the repository's language statistics: they are examples and fixtures.
*.uze linguist-language=Vue linguist-documentation
